Raw magical damage channels through the caster's weapon, increasing raw Physical Power by [14%, 33%, 48%, 60%, 71% (TL1-5)] of your Magic (current bonus: [14, 33, 48, 60, 71 (TL1-5; MAG 100; SP 100)]).

Each time you crit with a melee blow, you will unleash a radius [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] ball of arcane damage, doing [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; MAG 100; SP 100)].

The bonus scales with your Spellpower and talent level.

If you are using a shield this will only occur 50% of the time.

If you are dual wielding this will only occur 50% of the time.

At level 5 the ball becomes radius 2.
